  "prefLabel": "Plc 1905.02 Notification of Pending Certification Expiration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1905.02 Notification of Pending Certification Expiration. The licensing bureau shall notify each certificant of the pending expiration of the certificant’s certification in accordance with Plc 308.03.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1900.html"
